        // Declaration: void OCT_sequence(octSprite_t* spr, int from, int to, int framelen, octSeqRestart_t restart);
        // Comment: from/to > 0 replace the range, 0 keeps it. framelen >= 0 replaces the speed (0 = a new frame every tick, the FASTEST), -1 keeps it. Each frame lasts bmp.Rate * framelen + 1 ticks.
        // Comment: restart mode: OCT_SEQ_RESTART (play from 'from'), OCT_SEQ_REVERSE (play from 'to', backwards), OCT_SEQ_REFRESH (keep current position). Frames follow the packer's name_NN chain, not id arithmetic.
        // Comment: sprite fields: Loop, PingPong, Paused, FramesCooldown (ticks to wait at the end); OnEnd / OnCooldown are set for one tick when the sequence ends.
