    // Comment: octBmpInfo_t fields: Name[24], W, H (SCREEN pixels: texels x2 for half-res art, x1 for FULLSIZE), PivotX, PivotY (screen px from the top-left), Bx, By (bound centre relative to the pivot), Bw, Bh (bound half-size), Tags, Number, Group, Type.
